text All three of us had no choice but to abandon something we wanted to do because of bad luck.
text All three of us were denied our modest little high school dreams.
text ──"I understand that feeling."
text I hear Furukawa's words in my head.
text Us three are closer than I thought.
text And none of us ever used that bad luck as a shield.
text Sunohara and I never tried to get back into a club, and turned into the people we are now.
text And Furukawa is struggling to start all over from scratch after she spent nearly a year fighting her illness before finally beating it.
text That's why Sunohara can't forgive someone trying to use something similar as a shield.
text I... feel the same way.
